flowchart LR
  POSE[YOLO Pose all persons] --> D[17 keypoints + bbox + confidence per person]
  BED[Auto Bed mask] --> R[bed overlap per detection]
  D --> R
  R --> ASSOC{IoU + center-distance association}
  ASSOC --> T1[PersonTrack 1]
  ASSOC --> T2[PersonTrack 2]
  ASSOC --> TN[PersonTrack N]

  T1 --> SELECT{primary selector}
  T2 --> SELECT
  TN --> SELECT
  SELECT -->|bed overlap EMA| PRIMARY[Primary patient track]
  SELECT -->|previous ID continuity| PRIMARY
  SELECT -->|confidence + maturity| PRIMARY

  PRIMARY --> KERAS[6-class current pose]
  PRIMARY --> BUF[(track-id FrameBuffer)]
  PRIMARY --> TCN[(track-id TCN 10Hz runner)]
  TCN --> SHADOW[TCN shadow candidate]
  BUF --> STATUS[/status primary ID switch count]
  TCN --> STATUS

  SWITCH[primary ID switch] --> NEWBUF[new track history]
  EXPIRE[track TTL expiry] --> PURGE[purge old frame and TCN buffers]
  GAP[observation gap] --> RESET[reset only that track TCN]
